# Frozen design sources — the authority for the provenance chain
#   prototypes/v5 (frozen)  ->  prototypes/v6 (derived)  ->  web/ (generated)
#
# These are byte-level pins of the committed files, kept as a literal file and
# deliberately NOT computed by the tools that also pin them: a gate that
# recomputes its own expectation agrees with whatever the tree happens to
# contain.
#
# Verify from the repository root:
#   sha256sum -c prototypes/FROZEN.sha256
#
# `tests/release/test_release_gates.py` carries an independent copy of the same
# two digests, so editing one without the others fails.
